          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo yenīyī na a magūngūli gayo hū walī wingīji wa banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Nafutali, kūlenganīla nū mumo jalī ī ndūgū jabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.39",
